  "description": "DESCRIPTION\nAdd a warm and festive touch to your holiday décor with this beautiful Personalized Christmas Stocking Family SVG! 🎄🎀❤️\nThis charming Christmas design features a rustic wood-style stocking hanger sign with the festive phrase “The Stockings Were Hung”, a customizable family name, a decorative greenery and berry garland with a red bow, and multiple Christmas stockings that can be personalized with family members’ names.\nThe clean shapes, bold outlines, layered details, and classic Christmas colors make this design perfect for laser-cut wood signs, MDF decorations, acrylic projects, personalized stocking holders, and handmade Christmas décor. Customize the family name and stocking names to create a special holiday keepsake for your own family or a thoughtful personalized Christmas gift.\n📂 File Formats:\nSVG, AI, EPS, DXF, DWG, PDF\nCompatible With:\nGlowforge, xTool, LightBurn, OMTech, Thunder Laser, Aeon Laser, Cricut, Silhouette Designer Edition and most cutting machines that support SVG or DXF files.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>DESCRIPTION</p>\n<p>Add a warm and festive touch to your holiday décor with this beautiful Personalized Christmas Stocking Family SVG! 🎄🎀❤️</p>\n<p>This charming Christmas design features a rustic wood-style stocking hanger sign with the festive phrase “The Stockings Were Hung”, a customizable family name, a decorative greenery and berry garland with a red bow, and multiple Christmas stockings that can be personalized with family members’ names.</p>\n<p>The clean shapes, bold outlines, layered details, and classic Christmas colors make this design perfect for laser-cut wood signs, MDF decorations, acrylic projects, personalized stocking holders, and handmade Christmas décor. Customize the family name and stocking names to create a special holiday keepsake for your own family or a thoughtful personalized Christmas gift.<br>\n📂 File Formats:</p>\n<p>SVG, AI, EPS, DXF, DWG, PDF</p>\n<p>Compatible With:</p>\n<p>Glowforge, xTool, LightBurn, OMTech, Thunder Laser, Aeon Laser, Cricut, Silhouette Designer Edition and most cutting machines that support SVG or DXF files.</p>",
